        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Aquarius &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>Formed at &minus;273&deg;C, at the limit of absolute zero; its solidity is such that not even the strength of a Gold Saint could break it.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> @Damage[16d6[cold]] damage and slowed 2 for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> It is entombed in unmelting ice indefinitely: <strong>petrified</strong>, ageless, and needing no air. The coffin has Hardness 30 and 120 Hit Points. It ends only by being destroyed, by <em>dispel magic</em> (counteract rank 8), by a cold effect exceeding your own, or by your choice.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
